{
  "title": "Hirz-e-Janab-e-Fatemah (s.a.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This evil-repelling prayer is ascribed to Lady Fatimah (s.a.):\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME\nIn the Name of Allah; the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nيَا حَىُّ يَا قَيُّوْمُ بِرَحْمَتِكَ اَسْتَغِيْثُ \nYAA HAYYO YAA QAYYOOMO BE-RAHMATEKA ASTAGHEESO\nO Living, O All-Sustaining! By Your mercy I seek relief, \nفَاَغِثْنِىْ وَلَا تَكِلْنِىْ اِلٰى نَفْسِىْ \nFA-AGHISNEE WA LAA TAKILNEE ELAA NAFSEE \nso grant me relief. Do not leave me to myself \nطَرْفَةَ عَيْنٍ اَبَدًا وَ اَصْلِحْ لِىْ شَاْنِىْ كُلَّهٗ.\nTARFATA A’YNIN ABADANW WA ASLEH LEE SHA-NEE KULLAHU.\neven for the blink of an eye, ever, and rectify for me all of my affairs."
}
